&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfReductionEntryOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationForCorporateBondsIncludedInAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.6pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-27.6pt;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;"&gt;※９　「有価証券」中の社債のうち、有価証券の私募（金融商品取引法第２条第３項）による社債に対する保証債務の額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:20pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:381.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:201pt;min-width:201pt;"/&gt;
